### Add a comment to a file
POST http://localhost:8080/api/comments/comment
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "This is a comment on a file",
    "parent_type": "FILE",
    "parent_id": "6a059bce1497fb9f7037ee92"
}

### Add a comment to a Pull Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/comments/comment
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "This is a comment on a PR",
    "parent_type": "PR",
    "parent_id": "6a059bce1497fb9f7037ee91"
}

### Add a comment to an Issue
POST http://localhost:8080/api/comments/comment
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "This is a comment on an issue",
    "parent_type": "ISSUE",
    "parent_id": "6a059bce1497fb9f7037ee90"
}

### Get all comments for a file/pr/issue by passing parentId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/comments/all-comments/6a059bce1497fb9f7037ee92

### Delete a comment by commentId
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/comments/comment/6a059bce1497fb9f7037ee93
